  "source": "JoyPro curated on the maker's photo (2026-10-11), grip alone lying diagonally (upper head top left, base nut bottom right), seen on its control face which is turned slightly to the right: upper-head hats and cursor, lower-head panel with JETT cover, STOW toggle and EXT/RET hat; the collective tube and base are not in the photo",
